  "difficulty_reason": "After the named David-integrability and removability prerequisites are supplied, the original local core constructs continuous factors of discontinuous Bowen-Series maps by cyclic quotient and proves the degree, analytic pieces, critical data and normalized circle conjugacy. It refines the quotient boundary into a Markov partition with compatible round-disk neighborhoods to establish the required David extension, then glues group and polynomial dynamics using a globally invariant degenerate Beltrami coefficient. The final holomorphic realization and Mobius uniqueness through Sobolev removability form a substantial complex-dynamical uniformization beyond ordinary qualification conformal mapping.",
